      },
      "privateNotes": "",
      "publicNotes": "<p>A Bonded Soul companion in its Elemental base form. Link it to its owner with <strong>Sync Bonded</strong> on the owner's sheet: it then has the owner's level, AC, saves, Perception and Hit Points, and its Strikes use the owner's best attack modifier with their highest attribute to damage. Drag evolutions from the Apex Talents compendium onto it; the pool is 3 + the owner's level points, reallocated during daily preparations.</p><p>Strikes deal +1d6 of a chosen elemental type (acid, cold, electricity, fire, sonic). Immune to that type. At the owner's 10th level the rider becomes 2d6.</p>"
